python-validity (0.16~hp15) noble; urgency=medium

  * Recognize the complete 04 000100db and 05 000100db no-template packets
    on both 0xd51 and 0x969 firmware variants. Physical 138a:00ab / 0xd51
    hardware emitted interrupt 4 after reboot, disproving the previous strict
    subtype mapping while preserving exact-packet validation.
  * Remove the 25-rejected-frame daemon watchdog. Blank frames, poor contact,
    and a genuinely unresponsive quality gate are indistinguishable at that
    callback, so the threshold aborted healthy verifies while users were still
    approaching the reader. D-Bus clients now exclusively own timeout and
    cancellation; retry prompting remains throttled to one signal.
  * Add regression coverage for both packet variants, unrelated interrupt
    rejection, and 100 capture retries without daemon-side cancellation.

